    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The demon army launched a comprehensive attack, and with the help of various characters, the brave need to rely on their own wisdom to solve the crisis and restore world peace. </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game features: </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1. The focus is on thinking about what to do next, such as fighting monsters, collecting or talking to computer characters </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2. It is necessary to allocate attribute points reasonably to ensure one's strength </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3. You can retract the operation at any time and go back to the past, even if you have already died </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4. There is only one large map level without any scene switching </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5. There are no random events, and the same state and operation will only produce the same result </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The demon army launched a comprehensive attack, and with the help of various characters, the brave need to rely on their own wisdom to solve the crisis and restore world peace. </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Game features: </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1. The focus is on thinking about what to do next, such as fighting monsters, collecting or talking to computer characters </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2. It is necessary to allocate attribute points reasonably to ensure one's strength </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3. You can retract the operation at any time and go back to the past, even if you have already died </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 4. There is only one large map level without any scene switching </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5. There are no random events, and the same state and operation will only produce the same result </p>",
    "short_description": "Warrior's Dilemma is a casual strategy chess game where you play as a weak yet intelligent hero, constantly making advantageous choices in battles, unlocking, collecting, and trading to survive and become stronger until you ultimately kill the demon king.",
